### Get all lead statuses
GET http://localhost:5265/api/lead-statuses
Accept: application/json

### Get lead status by id
GET http://localhost:5265/api/lead-statuses/{id}
Accept: application/json

### Create lead status
POST http://localhost:5265/api/lead-statuses
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Qualified",
  "color": "#2ECC71",
  "isActive": true
}

### Update lead status
PUT http://localhost:5265/api/lead-statuses/{id}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Qualified Lead",
  "color": "#27AE60"
}

### Delete lead status
DELETE http://localhost:5265/api/lead-statuses/{id}
Accept: application/json

### Restore lead status
POST http://localhost:5265/api/lead-statuses/{id}/restore
Accept: application/json

### Password Hash check
GET http://localhost:5265/api/roles/test-hash